Disconnect a wireless client using a preview confirmation

Usage:
  olr network set client <id> <target> <mac> [flags]

Flags:
      --confirmation string   One-use confirmation from the operation preview
  -h, --help                  help for client

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")
